      "writtenOn": "2024-05-20T21:56:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would assume it\u0027s possible to get multiple connector_status messages prior to sending the ack_cc_ci command in the case that there are 2 IRQ events from the PDC in very quick succession. If that happens the get_connector_status command would have priority. But, even in that case (which I think in practice is very unlikely), the most recently read connector_status message would contain the most up to date value of change indicator bits.",
